        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, pipeline, long distance
Transport of natural gas in European pipeline after LNG evaporation.;
UUID: afb131c3-0df5-399a-85b8-f963929ae3a9
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of 1 tkm natural gas from the Middle East in an onshore pipeline.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Long-distance gas transport onshore with average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 1994, the data for energy requirements from 2001.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afb131c3-0df5-399a-85b8-f963929ae3a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
